[h2]Travel fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The Warden of the Spartan Crypt[/b] - another fix for the bug that closed his descent dialog the instant it opened, before you could choose to go down. A leftover timing delay on his greeting was racing the descend menu closed.
[*][b]Almyros in the Village of Helos[/b] now travels to the Garden of Merchants. The Uber Dungeon is reached from the Labyrinth of Knossos, further along the passage past the Minotaur, where a traveler takes you down.
[/list]

